	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literae tuae (vir clarissime) 6. maii scriptae 17. eiusdem mensis mihi demum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sunt redditae; audis ergo, quid causae sit, cur tardius rescribam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Tuum certe de <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> laetum et optatum nuntium nos omnes mirum in modum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>exhilaravit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Deus optimus maximus haec bona et auspicata initia ad optatum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quoque finem perducere pro sua clementia dignetur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ego quibus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>te rebus novis impertiar, non habeo, nisi quod tua scire tamen <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>interest, hoc ipsum ex me scire laboras, quo in statu ecclesia sit in <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><placeName ref="l520">Valle Telina</placeName> anque comitiorum decreta effectum habuerint.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">De quo <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ita accipias: com[m]issarios, quibus inter caetera haec quoque cura <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>commissa fuerat, strenue et optime se gesserunt et ii quidem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>praecipue, a quibus tu tale nihil exspectasses, quod mihi aliisque non <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>modo mirum accidit, sed insuper etiam solatio non mediocri fuit; <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>cum enim videre sit deum etiam, cum sibi visum fuerit, hominum non <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>usque adeo bene erga religionem affectorum opera quandoque ad nominis <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sui gloriam (ut ita dicam) a uti, in posterum etiam melius sperare <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>licebit, etsi mores hominum diversa nos ominari iubeant.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Unicus vicus <placeName ref="l329">Morben</placeName> vel morbidus potius com[m]issariorum decretis <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>non acquievit, de quo tamen iam in proximis hisce comitiis etc.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Habent illi malos consultores, et sunt ex piis, qui culpam reiiciunt in <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>eum, qui ibi cum potestate est (manent in ein potestat), qui est <placeName ref="l108">Davosianus</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>utque ex aliis audio, antehac optime se gesserat semper in religionis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>causa, ante inquam quam illuc cum potestate missus esset.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Pater est quaestoris <persName>Paul Puͦl</persName>; <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nunc factus est landtammen uff <placeName ref="l108">Thavoß</placeName>; nam prior, <persName>Gulerus</persName> scilicet, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>praeteritus est.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Capitaneus <persName ref="p8093">Hercules a Salice</persName>, quo patrono utuntur <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>pii in <placeName ref="l520">Valletelina</placeName>, <placeName ref="l108">Davosiano</placeName> hoc nomine litem intendit, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>et res in his proximis comitiis postridie hic futuris iure disceptabitur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Qui nunc capitaneus est in <placeName ref="l520">Valletelina</placeName> (haec est, ut scis, suprema illic <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>potestas) a religione nostra abhorret; fratrem habet canonicum <foreign xml:lang="de">hye <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>im gestifft, ist einer von <persName>Schouwenstein</persName>.</foreign></s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Magna autem est capitanei <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>in illis locis authoritas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Scis tu filios huius seculi prudentiores <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>in suo genere esse quam filios dei.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sed deus, qui adhuc ad gubernacula <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>sedet, nondum tamen omnem potestatem illis hominibus resignavit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Alioquin, quid largitiones in illis locis valeant, non te fugit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>enim moliatur <persName>pontifex Romanus</persName>, ne hoc suburbium <placeName ref="l834">Italiae</placeName> amittat, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>in confesso est.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Scribam hic quaedam, quae tibi serves, dum videamus rei exitum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Als jetz zuͦ <placeName ref="l18">Augspurg</placeName> die botten von eydgnossen sampt unseren <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>von dem r[ömischen] keiser abgefertiget worden sind, hat über das <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>unseren botten lenger uffgehalten und an ein ort genommen <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>und uff folgende wyß mit im geredt:</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">"Lieber burgermaister <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>von <placeName ref="l98">Cur</placeName>, last üch um meynentwillen befolchen syn den herren <lb xml:id="p1z41"/><persName>a Quadriis</persName> im <placeName ref="l520">Veltleyn</placeName>; befelcht in auch in meinem nammen <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>uffs best ir konnend gmainen <placeName ref="l893">Dry Pündten</placeName>, daamit <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>er an synem eerlichen fürnemmen nit gehinderet werde; wil ich's <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>um gmaine land im besten beschulden" etc.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><foreign xml:lang="de">Diser aber</foreign> (est familiae <persName>Quadriorum</persName>, <foreign xml:lang="de">si<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>nd ritter</foreign>) <foreign xml:lang="de">i<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>st für<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>habens, ei<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>n schuͦ<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>l <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>im <placeName ref="l520">Veltl<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>in</placeName> anzeric<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>hten</foreign> (<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>proc<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>ul du<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>bio s<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>u<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>mptibu<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>s po<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>ntific<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>is; exter<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>i enim <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>et <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>ad<lb xml:id="p2z24"/>ven<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>ae mon<lb xml:id="p2z26"/>ach<lb xml:id="p2z27"/>i non am<lb xml:id="p2z28"/>plius adm<lb xml:id="p2z29"/>itt<lb xml:id="p2z31"/>untur), ut e<lb xml:id="p2z32"/>ducar<lb xml:id="p2z33"/>entur <lb xml:id="p2z34"/>ibi filii <lb xml:id="p2z35"/><placeName ref="l648">Rhaetorum</placeName><lb xml:id="p2z37"/>, qui <lb xml:id="p2z39"/>eiici <lb xml:id="p2z40"/>postm<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z3"/>odu<pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>m <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>no<lb xml:id="p4z3"/>n <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>po<lb xml:id="p4z5"/>ssen<lb xml:id="p4z7"/>t.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Schluss von T. Schieß nicht abgeschrieben.]</note>
				</p>
